WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.177 --> 00:00:02.648
- It's mine, and it's
beautiful, and it's amazing.

00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:03.619
(whoosh)

00:00:03.619 --> 00:00:05.120
(hinges creaking)

